('0697286001', '0697286', 'Starfish Set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'All over pattern', 'White', 'Light', 'Baby Girl Jersey Fancy', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a top and pair of puff pants in soft cotton jersey. Sleeveless top with a small opening and button at the back of the neck and a lace trim at the hem. Puff pants with an elasticated waist and a frill trim around the hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0697286002', '0697286', 'Starfish Set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Stripe', 'Pink', 'Light', 'Baby Girl Jersey Fancy', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Girl', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a top and pair of puff pants in soft cotton jersey. Sleeveless top with a small opening and button at the back of the neck and a lace trim at the hem. Puff pants with an elasticated waist and a frill trim around the hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
