('0697755001', '0697755', 'DRY PANTS', 'Outdoor trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Kids Girl Outdoor', 'Children Sizes 92-140', 'Baby/Children', 'Kids Outerwear', 'Outdoor', 'Rain trousers in wind- and waterproof functional fabric with welded seams, elastication at the back of the waist and press-studs at the sides. Elasticated hems, a reinforced elastic strap under the feet and a reflective detail. Adjustable elastic braces with plastic fasteners. Unlined. The trousers have a water-repellent coating without fluorocarbons.', NULL, 0, 0),
