('0713929001', '0713929', 'SNACKS LL set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Solid', 'Dark Blue', 'Dark', 'Baby Exclusive', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Woven/Jersey/Knitted mix Baby', 'Baby Exclusive. Set with a jacket and pair of trousers in narrow-wale organic cotton corduroy. Jacket with notch lapels, buttons at the front, a chest pocket, flap welt front pockets and decorative buttons at the cuffs. Unlined. Trousers with an adjustable elasticated waist, pleats at the top, fly with a button, side pockets, fake welt back pockets and sewn-in turn-ups at the hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
