('0714000001', '0714000', 'Matt regular fit 2B blz', 'Blazer', 'Garment Upper body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Blazer S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Dressed', 'Single-breasted jacket in woven fabric with narrow notch lapels, a decorative buttonhole and two buttons at the front. Chest pocket, flap front pockets and one inner pocket. Decorative buttons at the cuffs and a double back vent. Lined. Regular fit – a classic fit with good room for movement over the shoulders and chest, which combined with a gently tapered waist creates a comfortable, tailored silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0714011001', '0714011', 'Estelle Scarf', 'Scarf', 'Accessories', 'Solid', 'Light Blue', 'Dusty Light', 'Scarves', 'Ladies Accessories', 'Ladieswear', 'Womens Big accessories', 'Accessories', 'Scarf in a thin weave with short, raw-edge fringes along the sides. Size approx. 60x200 cm.', NULL, 0, 0),
('0714026001', '0714026', 'Manson slim fit trs', 'Trousers', 'Garment Lower body', 'Solid', 'Black', 'Dark', 'Trouser S&T', 'Menswear', 'Menswear', 'Men Suits & Tailoring', 'Trousers', 'Suit trousers in woven fabric with a concealed hook-and-eye fastening and zip fly. Side pockets, jetted back pockets and legs with creases. Slim Fit – a fit that is close-fitting at the thighs, knees and ankles to create a fitted silhouette.', NULL, 0, 0),
