('0716575001', '0716575', 'KALLE set', 'Garment Set', 'Garment Full body', 'Stripe', 'Dark Blue', 'Medium Dusty', 'Newborn', 'Baby Sizes 50-98', 'Baby/Children', 'Baby Essentials & Complements', 'Jersey Fancy', 'Set with a long-sleeved bodysuit and pair of leggings in soft organic cotton jersey. Bodysuit with long sleeves and press-studs down one side and at the crotch. Leggings with an elasticated waist and legs with sewn-on ears and ribbed hems.', NULL, 0, 0),
